acy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T21:05:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T21:41:31Z","body":"I've updated this PR to include the latest from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110671 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110630. I've also added the [early draft prototype for Mac OS HDR output](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106814).\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I've needed to remove the Linux (wayland) PR for now because it breaks Vulkan support on Windows (we won't be shipping this anyway, but it makes for a difficult testing experience on Windows if you try to enable HDR output with default project settings.\r\n\r\nEdit: Build artifact for Mac OS fails checks, so you'll have to build it yourself to test this for now...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340521251/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3362651087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110701#issuecomment-3362651087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110701","id":3362651087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IbfvP","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription